{
  "title": "Krylov固有値解法",
  "html": "<h1>Krylov固有値解法</h1><p>Krylov固有値法は、巨大な行列全体を対角化せず、少数の固有対を小さい部分空間から近似します。Arnoldi、対称問題のLanczos、シフト反転では必要な仮定が異なります。</p><h2 id=\"model\">対象と代表式</h2><p>初期ベクトルvからKₘ(A,v)=span{v,Av,…,Aᵐ⁻¹v}を作ります。直交基底Vₘと上Hessenberg行列HₘのArnoldi関係から、Hₘy=θyを解いてx=VₘyをRitzベクトルとします。最後の基底ベクトルとhₘ₊₁,ₘが残差を表します。</p><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>y</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AV_m=V_mH_m+h_{m+1,m}v_{m+1}e_m^T,\\qquad \\|Ax-\\theta x\\|_2=|h_{m+1,m}e_m^Ty|\\quad(\\|y\\|_2=1).</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1774em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1774em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"algorithm\">計算の流れ</h2><p>行列ベクトル積と直交化で基底を伸ばし、小さい固有値問題を解き、必要に応じて再スタートします。AがHermitianならLanczosの三項漸化式が使えます。内部固有値には(A−σI)⁻¹を作用させる方法がありますが、各作用は線形系の解法を必要とします。</p><h2 id=\"conditions\">適用条件と落とし穴</h2><p>有限精度では直交性の喪失により重複した見かけの固有値が出ます。非正規行列の小残差は小さい固有値誤差を保証しません。一般化問題Ax=λBxではBの性質と内積を明記し、シフト反転の内部許容誤差も評価します。</p><h2 id=\"verification\">検証するときに見る量</h2><p>正規化した残差∥Ax−θx∥/(∥A∥+|θ|)、直交性、既知固有対、縮退/近接固有値を確認します。対称問題ではRayleigh商も比較し、再スタート数や初期ベクトル依存を記録します。</p><h2 id=\"publication-scope\">公開範囲と関連項目</h2><p>既存の教育用コードと版を固定した検証記録への案内です。今回の本文・翻訳の追加でコードや過去の測定結果を変更せず、原論文全体の再現を主張しません。</p><ul><li><a href=\"/numerical-methods-atlas/methods/eigensolvers/?lang=ja\">Krylov固有値解法</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sources\">一次文献・関連資料と確認範囲</h2><p>原著、後続の変種、著者による著書、概説、公式資料を区別して参照します。DOI・書誌の確認と原文の該当箇所の閲覧を区別し、論文全体の監査や数値再現を行ったという意味ではありません。確認範囲の注記は引用ごとに示します。</p><ol class=\"reading-sources\"><li id=\"source-arnoldi1951\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1090/qam/42792\">W. E. Arnoldi (1951). The principle of minimized iterations in the solution of the matrix eigenvalue problem</a>. Quarterly of Applied Mathematics<p>研究論文・提案または関連する定式化 · 書誌確認 · <a href=\"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1090%2Fqam%2F42792\">確認した資料</a></p><p>DOI登録等で著者・題名・刊行年と書誌的な同一性を確認。原文全体の監査や数値再現は未実施です。</p></li><li id=\"source-lanczos1950\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.6028/jres.045.026\">C. Lanczos (1950). An iteration method for the solution of the eigenvalue problem of linear differential and integral operators</a>. Journal of Research of the National Bureau of Standards<p>研究論文・提案または関連する定式化 · 書誌確認 · <a href=\"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.6028%2Fjres.045.026\">確認した資料</a></p><p>DOI登録等で著者・題名・刊行年と書誌的な同一性を確認。原文全体の監査や数値再現は未実施です。</p></li></ol>",
